{
  "_readme": [
    "Bluechip + mid-cap Meteora DLMM farmer (token-X / SOL pools). Copy to user-config.json and edit; restart after changes.",
    "Omitted keys fall back to the defaults in config.js. Secrets (keys, private key) belong in .env, never here.",
    "Scanner entries come from the Meteora pool scanner. manualPools additionally names pools the daemon keeps open (address, or a token/SOL name that matches one pool). Data APIs are Jupiter and Meteora only.",
    "Tiers: the token's Jupiter market cap picks bluechip (>= bluechipMinMcap) or midcap; below midcapMinMcap is rejected. Tier fields are flat keys <tier><Field>, e.g. midcapMinTvl.",
    "shadowMode: true forces DRY_RUN. dryRunSolBalance: simulated SOL for sizing while DRY_RUN is on (null = real balance).",
    "strategy: auto | spot | curve | bid_ask. Under auto, a coin label (coin-labels.json) picks labelStrategies / labelPoolRules / labelIndicators; unlabeled coins use the unlabeled* keys.",
    "Strategy entries: a shape, \"skip\", \"regime\" (use regimeStrategies), { \"regimes\": {...} }, or { shape, rangeVolMult, stopLossPct, outOfRangeWaitMinutes }.",
    "Pool rules: fee24 | tvl | fit | largest | smallest. Indicator gates/exits: see INDICATOR_GATES / INDICATOR_EXITS in standalone/indicators.js.",
    "jevMode: off | shadow | veto | approve (TYPESAFE_API_KEY in .env). takeProfitPct: null disables the fixed take profit."
  ],
